  "_help": {
    "customThemesHelp": "Each theme is a .json file in Nexus/Themes with four parts:\n\n\"Colors\" — every UI color, using readable names like \"Background\", \"Card\", \"AccentActive\", paired with an [R, G, B] value, e.g. \"Text\": [255, 255, 255].\n\n\"Gradients\" (optional) — give any color a smooth gradient instead of a flat color, e.g. \"Background\": { \"Colors\": [[18,18,18],[8,8,8]], \"Rotation\": 90 }.\n\n\"PreviewColor\" — the little bubble shown on your theme's card in this menu.\n\n\"Sounds\" (optional) — set \"NotificationSound\" and/or \"UIReadySound\" to a Roblox asset id to change or add sounds; leave either blank for none. An invalid id gets a warning in the output so you know it didn't load.\n\nAn \"Example Theme.json\" is always kept in that folder, fully filled in, so you can copy it as a starting point. Save your file, then press Refresh.\n\nFind themes made by others in our Discord, or share your own once you've made one.",
    "chatConnectError": "We couldn't connect you to the Nexus chat server.\nPlease restart Roblox and try again, if the issue keeps happening feel free to reach out to support."
  },
